#. module: account_collection_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_collection_sale/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "%(order)s has nothing left to invoice; collect its invoices instead."
msgstr "%(order)s ya no tiene nada por facturar; cobra sus facturas."

#. module: account_collection_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_collection_sale/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "%(order)s is not a cash sale: collect its invoices instead."
msgstr "%(order)s no es una venta de contado: cobra sus facturas."

#. module: account_collection_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_collection_sale/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"%(salesperson)s holds %(amount)s in collections past their hand-in date: "
"%(order)s, on credit terms, can be confirmed once they hand them in."
msgstr ""
"%(salesperson)s trae %(amount)s en cobros vencidos: %(order)s, a crédito, "
"podrá confirmarse cuando los entregue."

#. module: account_collection_sale
#: model:res.groups,comment:account_collection_sale.privilege_invoice_cash_sale
msgid ""
"A collector who holds no accounting right collects a confirmed cash sale on "
"the spot: the order's invoice is created, dated the day the customer paid "
"and posted in the collector's name, so the customer leaves with an issued "
"invoice and a receipt. Nothing else of accounting is theirs."
msgstr ""
"Un cobrador sin derechos contables cobra en el momento una venta de contado "
"confirmada: la factura de la orden se crea, con la fecha en que pagó el "
"cliente, y se publica a nombre del cobrador, de modo que el cliente se va "
"con su factura emitida y su recibo. Nada más de contabilidad le corresponde."

