#. module: account_collection_sale
#: model:ir.model,name:account_collection_sale.model_sale_order
msgid "Sale Order"
msgstr "Orden de venta"

#. module: account_collection_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_collection_sale.wizard_sale_order_cash_collect_view_form
msgid ""
"The order is invoiced and the invoice issued now; the money stays in\n"
"                    your custody until you hand it in."
msgstr ""
"La orden se factura y la factura se emite ahora; el dinero queda\n"
"                    bajo tu custodia hasta que lo entregues."

#. module: account_collection_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_collection_sale.field_sale_order__is_cash_sale
msgid ""
"True when the whole amount falls due on the invoice date itself: a single "
"100% line, no delay, counted from the invoice date."
msgstr ""
"Verdadero cuando todo el importe vence en la fecha de la factura: una sola "
"línea al 100 %, sin plazo, contada desde la fecha de la factura."

#. module: account_collection_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_collection_sale.field_wizard_sale_order_cash_collect__amount
msgid "What the customer paid you."
msgstr "Lo que te pagó el cliente."

#. module: account_collection_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_collection_sale.field_account_config__collection_hold_credit_sales
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_collection_sale.field_res_config_settings__collection_hold_credit_sales
msgid ""
"While a salesperson holds collections past their hand-in date, their sales "
"orders on credit terms cannot be confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Mientras un vendedor traiga cobros vencidos, sus órdenes de venta a crédito "
"no se pueden confirmar."

#. module: account_collection_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_collection_sale/models/stock_picking.py:0
msgid ""
"%(pickings)s could not be handed over: validate them from Inventory to see "
"what they ask."
msgstr ""
"%(pickings)s no se pudieron entregar: valídalas desde Inventario para ver "
"qué piden."

#. module: account_collection_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_collection_sale/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"%(products)s are not all at hand in %(location)s: leave the delivery of "
"%(order)s for later instead of handing it over now."
msgstr ""
"%(products)s no están completos en %(location)s: deja la entrega de "
"%(order)s para después en lugar de entregarla ahora."

#. module: account_collection_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_collection_sale.field_wizard_sale_order_cash_collect__hand_over
msgid ""
"Deliver the order now, from where its goods are at hand: the salesperson's "
"vehicle, or the warehouse when the customer picks it up."
msgstr ""
"Entrega el pedido ahora, desde donde está su mercancía: el vehículo del "
"vendedor, o el almacén cuando el cliente la recoge."

#. module: account_collection_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_collection_sale.field_stock_picking__is_handed_over_at_sale
msgid "Handed Over at Sale"
msgstr "Entregado en la venta"

#. module: account_collection_sale
#: model:res.groups,name:account_collection_sale.privilege_hand_over_cash_sale
msgid ""
"Privilege: a collector hands over the goods of the cash sale they collect"
msgstr ""
"Privilegio: un cobrador entrega la mercancía de la venta de contado que "
"cobra"

#. module: account_collection_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_collection_sale.field_wizard_sale_order_cash_collect__hand_over
msgid "The Customer Takes the Goods Now"
msgstr "El cliente se lleva la mercancía ahora"

#. module: account_collection_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_collection_sale.field_stock_picking__is_handed_over_at_sale
msgid ""
"The customer took the goods when the salesperson collected the cash sale; "
"the transfer travelled in no delivery."
msgstr ""
"El cliente se llevó la mercancía cuando el vendedor cobró la venta de "
"contado; la transferencia no viajó en ninguna entrega."

#. module: account_collection_sale
#: model:ir.model,name:account_collection_sale.model_stock_picking
msgid "Transfer"
msgstr "Transferencia"

#. module: account_collection_sale
#: model:res.groups,comment:account_collection_sale.privilege_hand_over_cash_sale
msgid ""
"When the customer takes the goods at once, the salesperson who collects it "
"records the quantities of the cash sale's outgoing transfers, from where its"
" goods are at hand, and validates them. Nothing else of inventory is theirs."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el cliente se lleva la mercancía en ese momento, el vendedor que "
"cobra registra las cantidades de las transferencias de salida de la venta de"
" contado, desde donde está la mercancía, y las valida. Nada más de "
"inventario es suyo."
